WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Capture the reference you need with FastPin.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Pin it, then move it away from the original page.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Resize the pin and switch to your editor.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Keep the field names visible beside your work.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Press Escape to close the pin when you are done.
